{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruments of Power is a tactical RPG set in a dark and crumbling fantasy world. You are a mage who made a world-shaking discovery \u2014 only to lose your body and unleash an ancient evil upon the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player casting a devastating fire and lightning spell\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c59c1cb19851290ecf42638301f00e6d.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player crafting a spell by dragging nodes in the spell editor.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the catalysts, effects and mods you discover to craft custom spells and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each spell carefully to counter their tactics and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/9c0a54bceb5b04f80aa9d9e139d6e72c.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player summoning more avatars.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is now bound to a mysterious sanctuary beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freed from the constraints of the flesh, you can invoke avatars of yourself to fight the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful yet disposable, each new avatar will weaken the tether keeping your soul in this world. Will you rush or bide your time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f648efc6e6949028127e7567459a8d40.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Enemy lancer hitting the player.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battleground is tainted, contested, and overrun by warped things born of the darkness you unleashed. Reclaim them through ruthless turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the force you released\u2014and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go to undo what you\u2019ve done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/d0ef0aaf7e0a9df5d0cdb211f72dcc20.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across two layers: the sanctuary and the tactical battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sanctuary, you interact with the Entity that saved your soul and prepare for what comes next. Manage your territory and spend your resources to craft spells, upgrade your avatars and extend your influence over the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ready, choose an enemy force to confront. The game then shifts to a tactical, turn-based battle where your avatars clash with hostile forces while activating ancient artefacts and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Ancient and broken monument.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/fbf62ea19b6b8cccbbaa9bb2eadbef48.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own spells</strong> by combining catalysts, effects, and mods earned in battle\u2014tailor your arsenal to counter powerful enemies and their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in deep, turn-based combat</strong> where positioning, timing, and synergy determine survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your force:</strong> choose when, where, and how many avatars to bring into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>diverse enemy roster</strong>\u2014each foe has distinct abilities and AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across hand-crafted maps</strong> featuring layered objectives and tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure loss:</strong> death sets you back as enemies reclaim territory\u2014but the war continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Influence</strong>, generated by your captured Sites of Power, to unlock new regions and cast devastating curses upon enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your avatars</strong> with Aether: enhance their stats and equip passive powers that reshape your tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront the Entity</strong> that saved you, deepen your knowledge of the world, and uncover the truth behind the darkness you set free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the ending:</strong> your choices lead to one of two radically different outcomes for the world\u2014and for yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/996b7c8939ce7fface9275fcc4640c9e.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=263 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791850?t=1765529892","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/133430d1379ee9fbf3c43888fbebe8c3d7cc3495/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765529892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/638c2a22ef687e959a222dffc70160d0e9e0640e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765529892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/638c2a22ef687e959a222dffc70160d0e9e0640e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765529892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features stylized but frequent combat involving magical violence. Players confront shadowy enemies in a dark world. Themes of death, identity, and moral ambiguity are explored. Some narrative elements may be unsettling."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruments of Power is a tactical RPG set in a dark and crumbling fantasy world. You are a mage who made a world-shaking discovery \u2014 only to lose your body and unleash an ancient evil upon the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player casting a devastating fire and lightning spell\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/1b14c75b9dee533f372c67ff130879a5.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c59c1cb19851290ecf42638301f00e6d.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player crafting a spell by dragging nodes in the spell editor.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/159ee00d38fb053d8cd220e4d453d70e.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the catalysts, effects and mods you discover to craft custom spells and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each spell carefully to counter their tactics and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/9c0a54bceb5b04f80aa9d9e139d6e72c.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Player summoning more avatars.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/730aea5bbb0f5ee7a65de96cad116fea.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is now bound to a mysterious sanctuary beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freed from the constraints of the flesh, you can invoke avatars of yourself to fight the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful yet disposable, each new avatar will weaken the tether keeping your soul in this world. Will you rush or bide your time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f648efc6e6949028127e7567459a8d40.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Enemy lancer hitting the player.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/86cdd74d1c9c7fec2d833b6215bb3c74.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battleground is tainted, contested, and overrun by warped things born of the darkness you unleashed. Reclaim them through ruthless turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the force you released\u2014and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go to undo what you\u2019ve done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/d0ef0aaf7e0a9df5d0cdb211f72dcc20.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across two layers: the sanctuary and the tactical battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sanctuary, you interact with the Entity that saved your soul and prepare for what comes next. Manage your territory and spend your resources to craft spells, upgrade your avatars and extend your influence over the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ready, choose an enemy force to confront. The game then shifts to a tactical, turn-based battle where your avatars clash with hostile forces while activating ancient artefacts and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.poster.avif?t=1765529892\" aria-label=\"Ancient and broken monument.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.webm?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.mp4?t=1765529892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/fbf62ea19b6b8cccbbaa9bb2eadbef48.avif?t=1765529892\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own spells</strong> by combining catalysts, effects, and mods earned in battle\u2014tailor your arsenal to counter powerful enemies and their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in deep, turn-based combat</strong> where positioning, timing, and synergy determine survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your force:</strong> choose when, where, and how many avatars to bring into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>diverse enemy roster</strong>\u2014each foe has distinct abilities and AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across hand-crafted maps</strong> featuring layered objectives and tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure loss:</strong> death sets you back as enemies reclaim territory\u2014but the war continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Influence</strong>, generated by your captured Sites of Power, to unlock new regions and cast devastating curses upon enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your avatars</strong> with Aether: enhance their stats and equip passive powers that reshape your tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront the Entity</strong> that saved y